menu "Usage Panel OTA"

config USAGE_OTA_MIN_BATTERY_PERCENT
    int "Minimum battery percent required for OTA on internal power"
    range 0 100
    default 40
    help
        Firmware updates are rejected unless the device reports external
        power or a battery percent greater than or equal to this value.
        A reading that cannot be taken also rejects the update (fail-closed).
        The name and the inclusive comparison are intentionally paired:
        MIN means at-or-above passes.

endmenu
